5,1,1,talk,Mio,,We need a place everyone can afford and enjoy. Let's look into the costs and transport first.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I agree. It would be lovely if we chose a place that helps the younger and older members bond.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We should also consider the administrative burden. We can't have the organizers burnt out before the camp starts.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,And we need to make sure we actually get some sleep! Last year was exhausting for so many people.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,We must be precise with the budget this time. No more guessing on the final fees.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,I'll check the transport receipts and the quoting terms for building lets to see about the fees.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I will look into what the seniors say about mixing and the attendance sheets from previous years.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I'll take the lottery application process and the canteen closure details to gauge the workload.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I want to know about the inland club accounts and the prefecture rate sheet for the beds.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I'll investigate the membership list against train times and the vacation timetable for our own hall.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
