30,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Transport costs vary wildly depending on distance. Also, some booking terms are very rigid regarding late cancellations.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Shizue,,It seems that shared sleeping arrangements are key to getting different year-groups to actually talk to each other.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,Some options involve a nightmare of paperwork or hours of cooking duty. We need to avoid that.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Public beds are cheap, but some inland centers have terrible sleeping conditions with too many people per room.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"Our own hall is crowded with other clubs, and many members can't even arrive on time without staying overnight.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Mio,,"If we go far, the transport cost becomes the biggest burden. We need a fair way to handle that.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"I'm also worried that if we don't pick the right spot, a fifth of our members might just not show up.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,A lottery system for bookings sounds like a recipe for stress. We need something more stable.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Rin,,I can't support any place where we're forced into overcrowded rooms with strict lights-out. We'll be exhausted.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Misaki,,Staying on campus isn't as simple as it looks. The logistics for non-commuters would be a financial mess.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Mio,,"So, a local option is cheaper, but a private lodge might be more comfortable.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Shizue,,But a private lodge must allow us to stay together to foster those friendships.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,As long as the lodge doesn't require us to cook every meal ourselves.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Rin,,Exactly. Comfort and sleep are non-negotiable for a productive training camp.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"I'm wary of any ""fixed headcount"" deposits. If someone drops out, the rest of us pay.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
