55,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Option A is cheapest for transport, but B is a middle ground. C is the most expensive.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Shizue,,Option A doesn't guarantee we'll stay together. B and C are better for social bonding.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option B has that lottery and paperwork. Option A has the canteen issue. C seems easiest to manage.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Rin,,Option B sounds like a sleep nightmare based on other clubs' experiences. A or C are better.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Option A is a logistical headache. Option C has risky non-refundable deposits. B is fiscally predictable.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Mio,,"I'm leaning towards A to keep it fair for everyone's wallet, despite the transport.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Shizue,,I can't support A; we need the members to actually bond. I prefer C for the atmosphere.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,I'm voting for C. I cannot deal with a nine-page application or cooking for everyone.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Rin,,I'm voting for C. I'd rather pay more than sleep eight to a room in a public center.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"I'll vote for B. The rates are fixed and public, which prevents the budget gaps we had last year.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Mio,,"Wait, if C is too expensive, will people actually come?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"If it's a beautiful lodge, they will want to come. It's about the experience.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"It's also about the organizers' sanity, Mio.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Rin,,I agree with Ryuji. Let's go for the lodge.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"I still worry about the deposit risk, but I see your points.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,4,talk,Mio,,"I'll change to C. If the majority wants the lodge, I'll support the social aspect.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
